# Vector byte/word popcount is legal with AVX512BITALG: 512-bit forms need
# only the feature, 256-bit forms are implemented with the 512-bit
# instruction when VLX is unavailable, and 128-bit forms still require VLX
# (GlobalISel currently miscompiles the widening pattern for them).

